---
config:
  startOnLoad: false
  theme: base
  htmlLabels: false
  fontFamily: Arial, Microsoft YaHei, Noto Serif CJK SC, sans-serif
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 16px
    primaryColor: "#e9f2fc"
    primaryBorderColor: "#296bb7"
    primaryTextColor: "#333333"
    lineColor: "#0b0b0b"

  themeCSS: |
    .node text,
    .nodeLabel,
    .label text {
      font-weight: 400;
      font-style: normal;
    }

    .node rect,
    .flowchart-link {
      stroke-width: 1px;
    }
---

flowchart TD
    A["1. 固定 workload"]
    B["2. warmup 后测<br/>step time / tokens per second"]
    C["3. CUDA workload 用 synchronize<br/>或 CUDA Event 正确计时"]
    D["4. torch.profiler 找最耗时的<br/>CPU / CUDA operator"]
    E["5. record_function 标记<br/>forward / backward / optimizer 等区域"]
    F["6. timeline 检查 CPU、GPU、Memcpy<br/>和同步关系"]
    G["7. 只对真正的瓶颈做优化"]
    H["8. 用同一个 benchmark 重新测量"]

    A --> B --> C --> D --> E --> F --> G --> H
    H -. "继续分析" .-> D
